+/*
+ * Some Ally firmware/EC combinations emit KEY_POWER while the userspace
+ * session is thawing after suspend. Steam's power-button handler treats it
+ * as a fresh press and immediately asks logind to suspend again.
+ *
+ * Detect the resume at the poll boundary: CLOCK_BOOTTIME includes time spent
+ * suspended whereas CLOCK_MONOTONIC does not. Then consume one full power
+ * button press/release in a short post-resume window. Normal short and long
+ * presses outside that window retain upstream behaviour unchanged.
+ */
+#define RESUME_DETECT_MS 100
+#define RESUME_GUARD_MS 10000
